# Paths removed from the PUBLIC snapshot (github.com/evymo/aisha-orchestrator).
# The upstream tree is never modified by this list — only the published tree is.
# One gitignore-style pattern per line; put the reason in the comment above it.
# Consumed by scripts/release/public-snapshot.mjs (see docs/release/PUBLIC_PREVIEW.md).

# Dependabot is not the dependency updater (that is scripts/aisha-deps-update.mjs). On the public
# mirror it only opened pull requests nobody merged (66 branches by 2026-09); the gate
# `owasp-orchestrator-adoption` still reads the file upstream, so it stays there.
.github/dependabot.yml

# .github/workflows/ is NOT excluded (since 2026-10-08): CI lives in .github/workflows/ and runs
# on GitHub-hosted runners or locally (npm run test:gates / test:run / test:services / test:db),
# so a public clone carries the same lanes and the gates that read them measure instead of skip.

# The container-signing workflow (cosign attestation of each image's SBOM) is not part of this tree:
# it signs with the maintainers' registry and signing identity. Listed here so the gates that read it
# (sbom-coverage, owasp-orchestrator-adoption, static-defense-in-depth) skip with this reason instead
# of failing; porting it as an opt-in GitHub Actions lane is tracked in
# docs/release/NEXT_PREVIEW_INTEGRATION.md.
.github/workflows/container-signing.yml
